: "L1013-P2-D", "prod_date": "2026-10-13", "press": "P2", "shift": "D", "shipment_id": "SH-1015-P2", "status": "in_transit"}, {"lot_id": "L1013-P2-N", "prod_date": "2026-10-13", "press": "P2", "shift": "N", "shipment_id": "SH-1015-P2", "status": "in_transit"}, {"lot_id": "L1013-P2-S", "prod_date": "2026-10-13", "press": "P2", "shift": "S", "shipment_id": "SH-1015-P2", "status": "in_transit"}, {"lot_id": "L1014-P2-D", "prod_date": "2026-10-14", "press": "P2", "shift": "D", "shipment_id": "SH-1016-P2", "status": "in_transit"}, {"lot_id": "L1014-P2-N", "prod_date": "2026-10-14", "press": "P2", "shift": "N", "shipment_id": "SH-1016-P2", "status": "in_transit"}, {"lot_id": "L1014-P2-S", "prod_date": "2026-10-14", "press": "P2", "shift": "S", "shipment_id": "SH-1016-P2", "status": "in_transit"}, {"lot_id": "L1015-P2-D", "prod_date": "2026-10-15", "press": "P2", "shift": "D", "shipment_id": "SH-1017-P2", "status": "in_transit"}, {"lot_id": "L1015-P2-N", "prod_date": "2026-10-15", "press": "P2", "shift": "N", "shipment_id": "SH-1017-P2", "status": "in_transit"}, {"lot_id": "L1015-P2-S", "prod_date": "2026-10-15", "press": "P2", "shift": "S", "shipment_id": "SH-1017-P2", "status": "in_transit"}, {"lot_id": "L1016-P2-D", "prod_date": "2026-10-16", "press": "P2", "shift": "D", "shipment_id": "SH-1018-P2", "status": "in_plant"}, {"lot_id": "L1016-P2-N", "prod_date": "2026-10-16", "press": "P2", "shift": "N", "shipment_id": "SH-1018-P2", "status": "in_plant"}, {"lot_id": "L1016-P2-S", "prod_date": "2026-10-16", "press": "P2", "shift": "S", "shipment_id": "SH-1018-P2", "status": "in_plant"}], "note": "cavity-level cause: whole lots are held because lots mix cavities"}, "report": {"en": {"D1": "Team: quality engineer (lead), production, maintenance, quality manager.", "D2": "What: burr on the snap-tooth edge. Where: OEM-J incoming inspection. How many: 19 of 1,600 sampled parts. Date codes 2026-09-29 to 2026-10-09.", "D3": "Containment: hold 57 lots of press P2 × cavity C3 made 2026-09-28 to 2026-10-16 (42 at customer, 12 in transit, 3 in plant). A blanket hold would have stopped 342 lots.", "D4": "Occurrence: the press P2 mould ran past its 250,000-shot maintenance limit from 2026-09-27 22:00 (up to 315,200 shots), so the cavity wore and flashed. The burr rate on press P2 × cavity C3 was 3.24% in the complaint date codes against 0.36% before.", "D4_escape": "Escape: gauge G-02 on press P2 was overdue for calibration since 2026-09-27, so out-of-spec parts passed inspection.", "D5": "Corrective actions: Repair the worn cavity, then add a maintenance interlock that stops press P2 at 250,000 shots; Calibrate G-02 now and add a calibration-due lockout to the inspection station.", "D6": "Implement and verify: confirm the defect rate stays at or below the previous 28-day baseline for two weeks after the fix.", "D7": "Prevent recurrence: update the PFMEA and control plan; read across to presses with the same equipment.", "D8": "Recognise the team and file this 8D as an approved case for future read-across."}, "ja": {"D1": "チーム：品質技術（リーダー）、製造、保全、品質保証マネージャー", "D2": "現象：スナップ爪エッジのバリ。発生場所：OEM-J 受入検査。数量：抜き取り 1,600 個中 19 個。日付コード：2026-09-29〜2026-10-09。", "D3": "暫定処置：press P2 × cavity C3 の 2026-09-28〜2026-10-16 製造分 57 ロットを保留（顧客先 42、輸送中 12、社内 3）。全数保留 342 ロットは不要。", "D4": "発生原因：プレス P2 の金型が 2026-09-27 22:00 から保全上限 250,000 ショットを超えて稼働し（最大 315,200 ショット）、キャビティが摩耗してバリが発生した。press P2 × cavity C3 の不良率は日付コード範囲で 3.24%、それ以前は 0.36%。", "D4_escape": "流出原因：プレス P2 のゲージ G-02 は 2026-09-27 から校正期限切れで、規格外品が検査を通過した。", "D5": "是正処置：摩耗したキャビティを修理し、プレス P2 を 250,000 ショットで停止する保全インターロックを追加する／G-02 を直ちに校正し、校正期限切れで検査を止めるロックアウトを追加する", "D6": "実施と効果確認：是正後2週間の不良率が過去28日平均以下であることを確認する。", "D7": "再発防止：FMEA・管理計画を改訂し、同型設備へ水平展開する。", "D8": "チームの貢献を記録し、本 8D を承認済み事例として登録する。"}}, "usage": null}